{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart@navapbc.com","data":{"body":"rebar attach-commits is documented as repairing a missing rebar-ticket trailer, but it does not satisfy the gate whose error message recommends it. Attached SHAs are read only by the file-impact-versus-diff check, never by the existence check at close_precheck.py:226, which uses the git-log scan alone. That is a rebar defect, not an ADP one."},"env_id":"8c3ef925-fbdc-4d88-8d59-f391cf59568c","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1789936218220715001,"uuid":"68353e9e-4601-401c-ad61-f83f0145f85b"}